        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mul-T-Lock 206S-HD2-THK Hercular Double Cylinder Thick Door Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith its truly unique design the MUL-T-LOCK Hercular thick door deadbolt is truly spectacular high security lock. The Hercular thick door deadbolt lock is reinforced in just about every way possible. From a UL437 Listed lock cylinder, to strong latch, to Bolt Bearing Mechanism, the Hercular Deadbolt will stop almost any attempt at forced entry. Strength usually does not mix with Flexibility. Not in the case of the Hercular, since it is a best rated Grade 1 Deadbolt, with an adjustable backset. The Hercular deadbolt is true <b>high security lock</b> that exceeds all high security standards.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Double Cylinder (Key on both the inside and outside) Deadbolt and is available in 7 different finishes. Supplied with two (2) keys and owner key card. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/mul-t-lock-hercular-thick-door-deadbolt-206sp-hd1-thk\"><b>Hercular Thick Door Deadbolt</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/grade-1-mul-t-lock-hercular-double-cylinder-deadbolt\"><b>Hercular Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMUL-T-LOCK's deadbolts are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the only person allowed to have the keys duplicated. Remove the worry about anyone making duplicates of your keys. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features </b> for Mul-T-Lock 206S-HD2-THK Double Cylinder Thick Door Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/2\" to 3-3/4\" Thick Door</li>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" Standard Bore Hole</li>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 1 Locking Mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Lock Design</li>\r\n<li>Two (2) Mul-T-Lock 206SP Security Keyways</li>\r\n<li>2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n<li>UL Fire Rated Latch</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset fits 2-3/8\" and  2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>UL437 Drill and Pick Resistance Lock Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>High Security Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b>. Key from both outside and inside. Do not use on Fire or Emergency exit doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: For use with <b>1-1/2\" to 3-3/4\" Thick Doors</b>.\r\n</p>",
